UI_STRING("未找到兼容的键盘控制器。\n本程序仅支持带单键 RGB 接口的 ITE8291 键盘（USB 厂商 ID：048D）。\n检测详情已写入程序目录中的 rgb_engine_log.txt。", "No compatible keyboard controller found.\nRequires an ITE8291 per-key RGB interface (USB vendor ID 048D).\nSee rgb_engine_log.txt beside the application for details.")
UI_STRING("Better RGB - 错误", "BetterRGB - Error")
UI_STRING("已找到键盘 RGB 接口，但无法打开。\n其他程序可能正在独占该接口，请查看程序目录中的 rgb_engine_log.txt。", "The keyboard RGB interface was found but could not be opened.\nAnother app may have exclusive access. See rgb_engine_log.txt beside the application.")
UI_STRING("无法进入单键 RGB 控制模式。", "Could not enter per-key RGB mode.")
UI_STRING("尝试重新取得独占控制后，无法再次打开键盘设备。", "Could not reopen the keyboard after trying to acquire exclusive access.")
UI_STRING("无法取得设备独占权：官方服务仍占用键盘 RGB 接口。\n为避免冲突，程序不会以共享模式启动。请稍后重试。", "The vendor service still holds the keyboard RGB interface.\nBetterRGB requires exclusive access. Please try again later.")
UI_STRING("Better RGB - 设备占用", "BetterRGB - Device busy")
UI_STRING("无法停止官方灯光服务或重新取得 RGB 接口独占权。\n为保护键盘 EC，程序不会以共享模式运行，请关闭控制中心后重试。", "Could not stop the vendor lighting service or acquire exclusive RGB access.\nClose the control center and try again. Shared access is disabled to protect the keyboard EC.")
UI_STRING("Better RGB - 无法取得独占控制", "BetterRGB - Exclusive access failed")
UI_STRING("官方服务（GCUBridge / 控制中心）正在占用键盘 RGB 接口，可能随时覆盖本程序的灯效。\n\n是否立即处理？程序会短暂重启官方服务并重新启动，以取得 RGB 接口独占权。风扇、性能和电源功能不受影响，Windows 会请求管理员权限。\n\n选择“否”将安全退出，本版本不允许共享模式。", "The vendor service (GCUBridge / Control Center) holds the RGB interface and may overwrite the lighting.\n\nAcquire exclusive access now? BetterRGB will briefly restart the vendor service and relaunch. Fan, performance and power features are not changed. Windows will request administrator permission.\n\nChoose No to exit. Shared access is disabled.")
UI_STRING("Better RGB - 需要独占 RGB 接口", "BetterRGB - Exclusive RGB access required")
UI_STRING("未获得管理员权限，无法安全取得 RGB 接口独占权。\n程序即将关闭。请重新启动并允许管理员权限请求。", "Administrator permission was not granted, so exclusive RGB access could not be acquired.\nBetterRGB will exit. Relaunch and allow the administrator request.")
UI_STRING("Better RGB - 权限不足", "BetterRGB - Permission required")
UI_STRING("窗口类注册失败。", "Window class registration failed.")
UI_STRING("同模具 ITE8291 - Better RGB 中文增强版 3.7.0", "Tongfang ITE8291 - BetterRGB Adaptive 3.7.0")
UI_STRING("主窗口创建失败。", "Main window creation failed.")
